## Error envelope in JSON mode

```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "validation_failed",
    "message": "Name is required.",
    "retryable": false,
    "remediation": "Pass --name.",
    "correlation_id": "req_123"
  }
}
```

## Exit codes

| Code | Meaning | Retryable |
| ---: | --- | --- |
| 0 | success | n/a |
| 1 | general failure | maybe |
| 2 | usage/validation error | no |
| 3 | permission denied | no |
| 4 | transient/retryable error | yes |

